     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Does a peace lily clean the air?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "A peace lily does not noticeably clean the air in a normal room. The studies that found plants removing chemicals were done in small sealed chambers. A 2019 review by Cummings and Waring concluded that a home would need far more plants than anyone keeps to match normal ventilation. Buy a peace lily for its flowers and leaves, not as an air filter."
     }
    },
