     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Can a peace lily live outside in the UAE?",
     "acceptedAnswer": {
      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "A peace lily is best kept indoors in the UAE. It must not get direct sun, it is not salt tolerant, and UAE summer days are far above the 20–29 °C it prefers. A fully shaded, sheltered spot in the cooler months is possible on the coast, but bring it in before summer and before cold inland nights."
