      "@type": "Answer",
      "text": "Plants are guaranteed to arrive healthy. Check your plant with the delivery agent: if it's damaged or not what you ordered, you can refuse it on the spot. If you find damage after unpacking, send photos and your order number on WhatsApp (+971 4 294 1422) or email sales@plantsworld.ae within 24 hours and we'll replace it free. You can also ask for a pre-dispatch photo."
     }
    },
    {
     "@type": "Question",
     "name": "Do the decorative pots have drainage holes?",
